      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/spring_drive_mobile_home_park_pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "W. Gene Henry and Roger Smith expanded the community in 1971 after purchasing a seventy-acre tract in the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
