      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/spring_drive_mobile_home_park_pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Spring Drive Mobile Home Park sits at an elevation of one thousand three hundred sixty-eight feet in southeastern Blair County.",
